</style></head>
<body><h1>Capelli Sport — CS Certification Exam · Set 7</h1>
<p><strong>Name: ____________________   Date: __________   Score: ______ / 100</strong></p>
<p>Closed book. Answer in the voice of the agent handling the ticket. For each scenario, state <strong>how you handle it</strong> (route + action) and <strong>the one trap</strong> that would fail the ticket. <strong>Section A — 6 points each; Section B (multiple choice) — 2 points each. Total 100.</strong></p>
<hr>
<p><strong>Q1.</strong> <em>"UPS says my package was delivered to my porch, but it's not here and I think it was stolen. What now?"</em> How do you handle a delivered-but-missing / possible theft claim?</p>
<p><strong>Q2.</strong> <em>"I ordered from capellisport.com two days ago — how long until it ships?"</em> What timeline do you quote for a capellisport.com (CS.COM) order?</p>
<p><strong>Q3.</strong> <em>"I ordered three red goalkeeper shirts and you sent me three blue field-player shirts instead."</em> Whose error is this, and how do you handle it?</p>
<p><strong>Q4.</strong> <em>"The jersey you personalized for my daughter has her name spelled wrong — you printed 'SARH' instead of 'SARAH'."</em> Personalized items are normally non-returnable — does that apply here? How do you handle it?</p>
<p><strong>Q5.</strong> <em>"Please cancel just the socks from my order — I don't need those — but ship the rest."</em> How do you handle a partial (single-item) cancellation and refund?</p>
<p><strong>Q6.</strong> <em>"How do I actually apply the patches to the jersey? Can I just iron them on at home?"</em> Give the customer the correct guidance.</p>
<p><strong>Q7.</strong> <em>"I live in Canada and want to order from my club's shop — can I do that, and how does shipping work?"</em> How do you handle an international order?</p>
<p><strong>Q8.</strong> <em>"The item I want is out of stock. I'd rather not wait forever — what are my choices?"</em> Lay out the cancel-or-wait options.</p>
<p><strong>Q9.</strong> <em>"After everything that went wrong with this order, I think you owe me something for the trouble."</em> How do you handle a request for compensation/goodwill?</p>
<p><strong>Q10. Multi-part policy question.</strong> <em>"A few quick things: Do you offer a military discount? Can I use a promo code on my order? And I have a $25 gift certificate — where can I use it?"</em> Answer all three correctly.</p>
<hr>
<h2>Section B — Multiple Choice (Q11–Q30)</h2>
<p>Choose the single best answer. 2 points each.</p>
<p><strong>11.</strong> A possible porch theft (scanned "delivered", not received):</p>
<ul><li>A) Instant refund</li><li>B) Verify scan/address, open a carrier claim, escalate</li><li>C) Ignore</li><li>D) Blame the customer</li></ul>
<p><strong>12.</strong> capellisport.com (CS.com) processing time:</p>
<ul><li>A) 3–4 business days</li><li>B) 5 weeks</li><li>C) 2 weeks</li><li>D) 5–10 business days</li></ul>
<p><strong>13.</strong> Ordered red, received blue (our error):</p>
<ul><li>A) A customer return</li><li>B) An exchange</li><li>C) Evidence photo + ship the correct item</li><li>D) No action</li></ul>
<p><strong>14.</strong> Capelli misspelled a personalized name. The non-returnable rule:</p>
<ul><li>A) Still applies — refuse</li><li>B) Doesn't apply — it's our error, replace it</li><li>C) Allows an exchange only</li><li>D) Means refund shipping</li></ul>
<p><strong>15.</strong> Cancel just one item from an order:</p>
<ul><li>A) Cancel the whole order</li><li>B) Refuse</li><li>C) Cancel that item + refund its value; the rest ships</li><li>D) Reship</li></ul>
<p><strong>16.</strong> The recommended way to apply patches:</p>
<ul><li>A) A heat press (~315–320°F); if at home, use a cloth and test first</li><li>B) A standard iron directly on the patch</li><li>C) Boiling water</li><li>D) A hair dryer</li></ul>
<p><strong>17.</strong> An international order requires:</p>
<ul><li>A) A US bank</li><li>B) A PayPal account + the customer pays customs/duties</li><li>C) A club password</li><li>D) Nothing special</li></ul>
<p><strong>18.</strong> OOS with no restock date — you offer:</p>
<ul><li>A) Cancel + refund, or wait (or an alternative)</li><li>B) A firm date</li><li>C) An exchange</li><li>D) Nothing</li></ul>
<p><strong>19.</strong> "You owe me something for the trouble":</p>
<ul><li>A) Issue a coupon yourself</li><li>B) Escalate — goodwill is a manager-approved exception</li><li>C) Refuse</li><li>D) Full refund on the spot</li></ul>
<p><strong>20.</strong> The military discount:</p>
<ul><li>A) Requires nothing</li><li>B) Needs a manager</li><li>C) Requires proof; 10% off the first order</li><li>D) Is a club code</li></ul>
<p><strong>21.</strong> Current promotions:</p>
<ul><li>A) 15% sitewide</li><li>B) None; suggest the newsletter</li><li>C) Free shipping</li><li>D) Ask the club</li></ul>
<p><strong>22.</strong> A gift certificate is redeemable at:</p>
<ul><li>A) teams.capellisport.com (plus equipment/fitness)</li><li>B) PayPal</li><li>C) Any store</li><li>D) Outlet only</li></ul>
<p><strong>23.</strong> "No exchanges" means:</p>
<ul><li>A) Swap freely</li><li>B) Return for a refund + a new order</li><li>C) Store credit</li><li>D) Keep both</li></ul>
<p><strong>24.</strong> Return window and condition:</p>
<ul><li>A) 60 days, worn OK</li><li>B) 14 days</li><li>C) 30 days, unworn/unwashed, tags on</li><li>D) Anytime</li></ul>
<p><strong>25.</strong> Which must NEVER be shared with a customer?</p>
<ul><li>A) The tracking number</li><li>B) The RO number</li><li>C) The return address</li><li>D) The processing time</li></ul>
<p><strong>26.</strong> A player-number change needs:</p>
<ul><li>A) Coach confirmation + a hold via Operations (if not in production)</li><li>B) An instant edit</li><li>C) A refund</li><li>D) A new order</li></ul>
<p><strong>27.</strong> A whole-team wrong-decoration issue:</p>
<ul><li>A) A blind reship</li><li>B) A photo of all + escalation</li><li>C) A refund only</li><li>D) To be ignored</li></ul>
<p><strong>28.</strong> Refund timing/label (BigCommerce):</p>
<ul><li>A) 30 days, club name</li><li>B) 3–5 business days, "CAPELLI SPORT"</li><li>C) Instant</li><li>D) 24h, bank name</li></ul>
<p><strong>29.</strong> A repeat defect on a replacement:</p>
<ul><li>A) Reship identically</li><li>B) Escalate; confirm corrected artwork first</li><li>C) Refund silently</li><li>D) Ignore</li></ul>
<p><strong>30.</strong> Team-store password requests:</p>
<ul><li>A) Provide it</li><li>B) Direct to the coach/club admin; never share</li><li>C) Reset it</li><li>D) Email it</li></ul></body></html>